  "label": "frustration expressed through being gagged",
  "description": "The woman's pose—hand on head, other hand on hip, with duct tape over her mouth—conveys a strong sense of frustration, helplessness, and suppression. The gagged mouth visually represents her inability to speak or be heard, while the posture suggests exasperation or being overwhelmed. This emotional state is not one of passive compliance but of active resistance or distress at being silenced.",
